          "text": "With 13+ years of experience scaling 140+ cloud kitchens and generating 3.5M+ food delivery orders, we understand delivery kitchen unit economics, aggregator algorithms, peak-hour hunger triggers, and WhatsApp D2C monetization better than anyone."
        }
      }
    ]
